    {
      "kind": "heading",
      "level": 1,
      "text": "Complete Module Catalog",
      "anchor": "complete-module-catalog"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "This catalog makes every package-defined Nodics module reachable from the public documentation. It is an inventory and navigation aid, not a second source of module identity or behavior. The module package metadata and its README remain authoritative."
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "Use the [Module Documentation Index](/docs/reference/module-documentation-index) when you know the business or platform task. Use this catalog when you know a module, group, environment, server, or node name."
    },
